    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "4786aa11a8864a6d39a56097da3450f214bfbe0a5c441d05b54615faa9429c30",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "はい！\nアナさんのお話であった和菓子、お団子です！",
      "jp_sha256": "3a9c5edf17fbd251d967197c25cbdfa0134663d3977d6cf29066ec677fc97c8e",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "네!\n아나 씨가 말씀하신 화과자, 경단이에요!",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 25,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "bb01badcea91c3cdf62a9c866b915cde0d9eff25a4af19b2571352ce5a051499:000002_210803540280846530:g0:r24",
      "row_index_0based": 24,
      "serialized_row_index": 24,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "はい！\nアナさんのお話であった和菓子、お団子です！"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "b6709a1d898280139e872e66dd2a26e0e992600e25903915d9899b7ec2609ac7",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "和菓子が好きだというアナさんのために、\nゲシュペンス島の食材を利用して作った色とりどりのお団子。\n試行錯誤の末に完成したそれを、アナさんに手渡す。",
      "jp_sha256": "fd1766c5424feddad0e7ea10a8460a709d91377c439e819b7c2c141aacae7064",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "화과자를 좋아한다는 아나 씨를 위해,\n게슈펜스 섬의 식재료를 이용해 만든 알록달록한 경단.\n시행착오 끝에 완성한 그것을 아나 씨에게 건넸다.",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 35,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
