    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "21528eaa5daa781d5dc2d0190658acd3ee583e3a810ae39ca3970ef0c6389ba6",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 10,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "見たところ、これは手作りのお団子です。\nこれを作るのには相当な労力が必要だったのでは？",
      "jp_sha256": "e7fb6289e31a9bfacd0f3ae6551f544eb8ff587f0e771ba9cc28c659eec8a712",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "보기에도 이건 수제 경단이군요.\n이걸 만드는 데 상당한 노력이 필요하지 않았나요?",
      "message_index_0based": 10,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 70,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
